<td tEditID="c1r2" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r2" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; text-align: justify; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;" class="MsoNormal"><br></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; text-align: justify; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;" class="MsoNormal">{!Lead.FirstName},<br><br>Thank you for activating your Working Capital Account!<br></p><ul style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><li>Credit Limit:&nbsp; Can qualify up to $500,000</li><li>Account Executive:&nbsp; {!Lead.OwnerFullName}</li></ul><p style="margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; text-align: justify; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;" class="MsoNormal">You've
 gotten this far in business by making smart decisions.&nbsp; Now it is time 
to make another one.&nbsp; Use your Account to get cash 
for your business.&nbsp; You decide how you want to use the money.&nbsp; For over 
16 years we've helped thousands of businesses with cash needs to 
expand, purchase inventory, advertise, make payroll, and pay other expenses. &nbsp;Here's a short video explaining how easy it is to work with us:<br><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;"><br><b>Video:</b></span><span style="font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;<u><font style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);" color="#3333ff"><a href="https://www.nationalfunding.com/videos/how-to-apply-for-a-small-business-loan/">How To Apply For A Small Business Loan</a></font></u></span><br><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;"><br>It
 only takes a few minutes to get started. &nbsp;Receive a decision in minutes and funding in as little as 1 business day.<br></span><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;"><br>Give me a call at {!Lead.OwnerPhone} and we can discuss your options to see what suits your business the best.</span></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">{!Lead.OwnerFullName}<br><span style="font-weight: bold; font-style: italic;">National Funding</span><br>Phone:&nbsp; {!Lead.OwnerPhone}<br>Email:&nbsp; {!Lead.OwnerEmail}</p>]]></td>
</tr>
